artamento decorado por arquiteto\n\t•\tapartamento de alto padrão em Curitiba\n\t•\tapartamento 3 quartos com suíte\n\t•\tarquitetura de autor Curitiba\n\n📍 Vaz Batel – Curitiba/PR\n\nEntre em contato para mais informações e agende sua visita.\nUm apartamento que vai além do morar: um projeto para viver com estilo.","fotos":["https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/698b35a02d6182da08b0fe21/pilar-homes-images-watermark/7925dc5b-870b-49ff-9b80-7e903b0b523d.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/698b35a02d6182da08b0fe21/pilar-homes-images-watermark/85ff6d07-387a-4f75-9227-2127f234235e.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/698b35a02d6182da08b0fe21/pilar-homes-images-watermark/e9d81562-936f-436a-80a0-72337876a0e2.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/698b35a02d6182da08b0fe21/pilar-homes-images-watermark/28741a3f-2c63-437c-af27-983f28aec5ae.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/698b35a02d6182da08b0fe21/pilar-homes-images-watermark/5803ac1e-2651-4442-9626-ab6da6b08460.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/698b35a02d6182da08b0fe21/pilar-homes-images-watermark/ecd08138-39cd-4f98-802a-198309f0dec5.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/698b35a02d6182da08b0fe21/pilar-homes-images-watermark/a76336ea-938c-4756-a3ec-e971254c2009.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/698b35a02d6182da08b0fe21/pilar-homes-images-watermark/490cbb8a-28eb-4eba-86bb-4a9de4c61de9.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/698b35a02d6182da08b0fe21/pilar-homes-images-watermark/9062c2fa-465e-4390-aff3-f1e6f6f33111.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/698b35a02d6182da08b0fe21/pilar-homes-images-watermark/cac746ea-c885-4305-8566-f5d08d360977.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/698b35a02d6182da08b0fe21/pilar-homes-images-watermark/34272756-931e-4b01-bb6b-c6f8ec9c829b.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox